{"unit_id":"1015677515__dsh-theme-holo#caveat-1","repo":"1015677515/dsh-theme-holo","commit":"2867b2a6e2558528772194fffe469cd8eff4ac32","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-theme-holo 使用前须知：独立黄昏酒馆素材包不会随插件安装；只有用户点击设置中的下载按钮时，宿主才从 GitHub 获取压缩包并写入插件的 tavern/ 目录。（见 index.js:450-486）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:450-486"]}
